  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Fill a cocktail shaker with ice; add pumpkin pie filling, spiced rum, half-and-half, milk, cinnamon, and nutmeg. Cover and shake until the outside of the shaker has frosted. Strain into a martini glass and serve.",
